  "body": "The intent is to make it happen for about:blank (though see https://github.com/whatwg/fetch/issues/384), and in the spec it's all the same since basic fetch will error out on other about: URLs.  But in browsers, other about: URLs are implemented, and it would be safer from a security standpoint to only do the weird \"make it same-origin\" thing for about:blank, not all about: URLs.\n",
